 "remarks": "Fabulous 3 bedroom and 2 full bathroom apartment. Located in a new luxury midsize building in one of Stamford's sought-after water communities. Contemporary open floor plan. The kitchen has stainless steel appliances and Caesarstone countertops. Gleaming hardwood floors throughout, European energy efficient windows, Gas heat, central A/C and an intercom entrance. Washer and dryer located in unit. Located just minutes away from Cove Island Beach and Park, with beaches, picnic areas, walking/running trails, playgrounds, tennis courts, ice rink and a marina overlooking Long Island Sound. Easy access to I-95, Chelsea Piers, the train station and vibrant downtown Stamford. This home has exterior video recording devices.",
